Date: 2026-04-23
Descriptor: autonomous_pass (validates ADR 0018)
Purpose:
    Demonstrate that a single `autonomous_pass` call — given only a
    config, no canonical forms, no instance lists, no user hints —
    proposes and names pattern types directly from R data. Confirm
    idempotence on a second pass.

Mechanism version:
    ADR 0018 (AutonomousConfig, AutonomousOutcome, AutonomousSkip,
    autonomous_pass) composing discover_motifs (0016) +
    refine_candidates (0017) + find_instances_of (0015) +
    name_pattern_instances (0010).
    Source: v2/src/lib.rs at the commit implementing 0018.
    Runner: v2/examples/autonomous_pass.rs.

Command:
    cargo run --example autonomous_pass

